  "_doc": "Kid-safe text rules shared by the server (SafeText.php) and the app (socialModel.ts). Keep the two copies identical: backend resources/safetext/rules.json and app src/screens/threads/safetextRules.json. Patterns are case-insensitive regex without delimiters, run on several normalised forms of the text. {CHAT}, {APPS}, {HANDLE}, {MAIL}, {SPOT} are substituted. R5: distress (self-harm about the author) and review_you + review_topics / review_phrases (hold for a person) are not blocks; see SafeText::isDistress and ::needsReview. tens/teens turn number words like 'fifty five' into digits.",
